---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Newsletter"
  description="Follow new posts with the RSS feed until a real mailing list exists."
  permalink="/newsletter/"
>
  <article class="reading prose">
    <p class="kicker">Follow</p>
    <h1>Newsletter</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      There is no email list yet. The honest way to follow along is the RSS feed, which already updates
      when I publish.
    </p>
    <p>
      Subscribe in any reader you like:
      <a href="/feed.xml">https://arshadmehmood.com/feed.xml</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you want a one-off note,{' '}
      <a href="/contact/">write to me</a>
      {' '}instead of waiting on a signup form that does not exist.
    </p>
  </article>
</Base>
